{"units":[{"id":"ru-a","st":"cyr","set":1,"group":"friend","t":"А а","name":"а","roman":"a","say":"а","note":"a as in 'father'; unstressed often like 'u' in 'cut'","confuse":["ru-ya","ru-o"],"ex":[["w0012","a"],["w0014","tak"],["w0015","kak"]]},{"id":"ru-k","st":"cyr","set":1,"group":"friend","t":"К к","name":"ка","roman":"k","say":"ка","note":"k","confuse":["ru-kh","ru-zh"],"ex":[["w0015","kak"],["w0027","k"],["w0048","kto"]]},{"id":"ru-m","st":"cyr","set":1,"group":"friend","t":"М м","name":"эм","roman":"m","say":"ма","note":"m","confuse":["ru-t","ru-n"],"ex":[["w0180","mama"],["w0084","tam"]]},{"id":"ru-o","st":"cyr","set":1,"group":"friend","t":"О о","name":"о","roman":"o","say":"о","note":"o when stressed; like 'a' when not","confuse":["ru-a","ru-yo"],"ex":[["w0026","o"],["w0041","ot"],["w0019","to"]]},{"id":"ru-t","st":"cyr","set":1,"group":"friend","t":"Т т","name":"тэ","roman":"t","say":"та","note":"t (italic т looks like m)","confuse":["ru-m","ru-p"],"ex":[["w0014","tak"],["w0019","to"],["w0050","tot"]],"italic":"т"},{"id":"ru-ye","st":"cyr","set":1,"group":"friend","t":"Е е","name":"е","roman":"ye","alt":["e"],"say":"е","note":"ye as in 'yes'; e after a consonant, which it softens","confuse":["ru-yo","ru-e"],"ex":[["w0850","tema"],["w0977","tem"]]},{"id":"ru-v","st":"cyr","set":2,"group":"false","t":"В в","name":"вэ","roman":"v","say":"ва","note":"v, not b","confuse":["ru-b","ru-soft"],"ex":[["w0001","v"],["w0062","vot"],["w0177","vmeste"]]},{"id":"ru-n","st":"cyr","set":2,"group":"false","t":"Н н","name":"эн","roman":"n","say":"на","note":"n, not h","confuse":["ru-p","ru-i"],"ex":[["w0003","ne"],["w0005","na"],["w0020","no"]]},{"id":"ru-r","st":"cyr","set":2,"group":"false","t":"Р р","name":"эр","roman":"r","say":"ра","note":"rolled r, not p","confuse":["ru-p","ru-ya"],"ex":[["w0140","ruka"],["w0500","reka"],["w0523","restoran"]]},{"id":"ru-s","st":"cyr","set":2,"group":"false","t":"С с","name":"эс","roman":"s","say":"са","note":"s, not k","confuse":["ru-e","ru-ye"],"ex":[["w0008","s"],["w0113","sam"],["w0182","storona"]]},{"id":"ru-u","st":"cyr","set":2,"group":"false","t":"У у","name":"у","roman":"u","say":"у","note":"oo as in 'moon', not y","confuse":["ru-ch","ru-i-short"],"ex":[["w0018","u"],["w0222","utro"],["w0506","urok"]]},{"id":"ru-kh","st":"cyr","set":2,"group":"false","t":"Х х","name":"ха","roman":"kh","alt":["h","x"],"say":"ха","note":"ch as in Scottish 'loch', not x","confuse":["ru-zh","ru-k"],"ex":[["w0562","sakhar"]]},{"id":"ru-b","st":"cyr","set":3,"group":"new","t":"Б б","name":"бэ","roman":"b","say":"ба","note":"b","confuse":["ru-v","ru-soft"],"ex":[["w0115","bez"],["w0158","boleye"],["w0223","bog"]]},{"id":"ru-g","st":"cyr","set":3,"group":"new","t":"Г г","name":"гэ","roman":"g","say":"га","note":"g as in 'go'","confuse":["ru-p","ru-d"],"ex":[["w0046","god"],["w0072","gde"],["w0145","gorod"]],"italic":"г"},{"id":"ru-d","st":"cyr","set":3,"group":"new","t":"Д д","name":"дэ","roman":"d","say":"да","note":"d (italic д looks like g)","confuse":["ru-l","ru-g"],"ex":[["w0058","do"],["w0069","delo"],["w0071","drugoj"]],"italic":"д"},{"id":"ru-z","st":"cyr","set":3,"group":"new","t":"З з","name":"зэ","roman":"z","say":"за","note":"z","confuse":["ru-e","ru-zh"],"ex":[["w0025","za"],["w0343","zavtra"],["w0351","zakon"]]},{"id":"ru-i","st":"cyr","set":3,"group":"new","t":"И и","name":"и","roman":"i","say":"и","note":"ee as in 'see' (italic и looks like u)","confuse":["ru-i-short","ru-n"],"ex":[["w0004","i"],["w0023","iz"],["w0061","ili"]],"italic":"и"},{"id":"ru-i-short","st":"cyr","set":3,"group":"new","t":"Й й","name":"и краткое","roman":"j","say":"ай","note":"short y as in 'boy'","confuse":["ru-i","ru-u"],"ex":[["w0034","svoj"],["w0035","moj"],["w0045","takoj"]]},{"id":"ru-l","st":"cyr","set":3,"group":"new","t":"Л л","name":"эль","roman":"l","say":"ла","note":"l","confuse":["ru-d","ru-p"],"ex":[["w0100","li"],["w0340","ladno"],["w0487","les"]]},{"id":"ru-p","st":"cyr","set":3,"group":"new","t":"П п","name":"пэ","roman":"p","say":"па","note":"p (italic п looks like n)","confuse":["ru-l","ru-n"],"ex":[["w0021","po"],["w0059","prosto"],["w0099","posle"]],"italic":"п"},{"id":"ru-f","st":"cyr","set":3,"group":"new","t":"Ф ф","name":"эф","roman":"f","say":"фа","note":"f","confuse":["ru-kh","ru-r"],"ex":[["w0408","telefon"],["w0488","kofe"]]},{"id":"ru-zh","st":"cyr","set":4,"group":"hush","t":"Ж ж","name":"жэ","roman":"zh","say":"жа","note":"s as in 'pleasure'","confuse":["ru-kh","ru-sh"],"ex":[["w0036","zhe"],["w0152","zhenshchina"],["w0255","zhena"]]},{"id":"ru-ts","st":"cyr","set":4,"group":"hush","t":"Ц ц","name":"цэ","roman":"ts","alt":["c"],"say":"ца","note":"ts as in 'cats'","confuse":["ru-shch","ru-sh"],"ex":[["w0328","tsentr"],["w0171","otets"],["w0174","konets"]]},{"id":"ru-ch","st":"cyr","set":4,"group":"hush","t":"Ч ч","name":"че","roman":"ch","say":"ча","note":"ch as in 'church'","confuse":["ru-u","ru-ts"],"ex":[["w0006","chto"],["w0077","chelovek"],["w0110","chem"]]},{"id":"ru-sh","st":"cyr","set":4,"group":"hush","t":"Ш ш","name":"ша","roman":"sh","say":"ша","note":"hard sh","confuse":["ru-shch","ru-ts"],"ex":[["w0200","shkola"],["w0054","khoroshij"],["w0066","nash"]]},{"id":"ru-shch","st":"cyr","set":4,"group":"hush","t":"Щ щ","name":"ща","roman":"shch","alt":["sch"],"say":"ща","note":"long soft sh","confuse":["ru-sh","ru-ts"],"ex":[["w0152","zhenshchina"],["w0240","voobshche"],["w0290","obshchij"]]},{"id":"ru-y","st":"cyr","set":5,"group":"vowel","t":"Ы ы","name":"ы","roman":"y","say":"ы","note":"a dark i, said with the tongue pulled back","confuse":["ru-soft","ru-i"],"ex":[["w0011","ty"],["w0013","my"],["w0016","vy"]]},{"id":"ru-e","st":"cyr","set":5,"group":"vowel","t":"Э э","name":"э","roman":"e","say":"э","note":"e as in 'bed'","confuse":["ru-ye","ru-z"],"ex":[["w0009","eto"],["w0031","etot"],["w0187","poetomu"]]},{"id":"ru-yu","st":"cyr","set":5,"group":"vowel","t":"Ю ю","name":"ю","roman":"yu","say":"ю","note":"yu as in 'you'","confuse":["ru-u","ru-ya"],"ex":[["w0074","lyudi"],["w0231","sleduyushchij"],["w0233","lyuboj"]]},{"id":"ru-ya","st":"cyr","set":5,"group":"vowel","t":"Я я","name":"я","roman":"ya","say":"я","note":"ya as in 'yard'","confuse":["ru-a","ru-r"],"ex":[["w0002","ya"],["w0389","yazyk"],["w0571","yabloko"]]},{"id":"ru-yo","st":"cyr","set":5,"group":"vowel","t":"Ё ё","name":"ё","roman":"yo","say":"ё","note":"yo as in 'yonder'; always stressed","confuse":["ru-ye","ru-o"],"ex":[["w0032","vsyo"],["w0042","yeshchyo"],["w0104","rebyonok"]]},{"id":"ru-soft","st":"cyr","set":6,"group":"sign","t":"Ь ь","name":"мягкий знак","roman":"(soft)","sound":false,"note":"no sound: softens the consonant before it","confuse":["ru-hard","ru-b"],"ex":[["w0007","byt'"],["w0022","moch'"],["w0028","ves'"]]},{"id":"ru-hard","st":"cyr","set":6,"group":"sign","t":"Ъ ъ","name":"твёрдый знак","roman":"(hard)","sound":false,"note":"no sound: keeps a y sound after it apart","confuse":["ru-soft","ru-b"],"ex":[["w0836","ob\"yasnit'"],["w1061","ob\"yekt"],["w1230","ob\"yavit'"]]}],"notes":[{"st":"cyr","set":1,"h":"Stress","body":"Every word has one stressed syllable. Unstressed о sounds like a, and unstressed е and я lean towards i. Words in this pack mark the stress: тако́й."},{"st":"cyr","set":2,"h":"False friends","body":"В Н Р С У Х look like Latin letters but say v n r s u kh."},{"st":"cyr","set":6,"h":"Soft and hard sign","body":"Ь and Ъ have no sound. Ь softens the consonant before it (мать); Ъ keeps a following е ё ю я apart from the consonant (подъезд)."}]}
